<li><a href="/drylining-faq/what-is-metal-frame-dry-lining/" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 500;">What is metal frame dry lining?</a></li>
<li><a href="/drylining-faq/how-thick-is-a-drylined-wall/" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 500;">How thick is a drylined wall?</a></li>
<li><a href="/drylining-faq/can-dry-lining-improve-soundproofing/" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 500;">Can dry lining improve soundproofing?</a></li>
